I will remove you as captain of the Blackship.

01:30:03.660 --> 01:30:05.900
You don't have that power.

01:30:06.140 --> 01:30:13.240
I have the power to excommunicate you and curse you and everyone who serves you in the name of God.

01:30:15.440 --> 01:30:16.300
You can do it, Captain.

01:30:16.870 --> 01:30:17.750
Madonna, he will.

01:30:19.100 --> 01:30:19.920
Order the men aboard.

01:30:32.140 --> 01:30:32.780
Captain, you here?

01:30:38.810 --> 01:30:39.910
Curse, you...

01:30:40.670 --> 01:30:41.230
English!

01:31:09.080 --> 01:31:13.160
Nomine patris, et filii, et spiritus sancti, amen.

01:31:14.140 --> 01:31:14.560
What happened?

01:31:15.680 --> 01:31:16.120
Who's dead?

01:31:20.460 --> 01:31:21.320
Captain Inglés.

01:31:23.550 --> 01:31:24.250
It's the captain.

01:31:26.600 --> 01:31:28.420
You've got the devil's luck on your back.

01:31:29.260 --> 01:31:29.720
Brother Michael!

01:31:31.630 --> 01:31:35.630
It was my duty, Eminence. To protect you. Duty!

01:31:38.560 --> 01:31:39.260
Yes, Michael, yes.

01:31:50.630 --> 01:31:52.580
The black ship was sailing on the tide.

01:31:53.260 --> 01:31:53.700
Then sail.

01:31:54.130 --> 01:31:54.890
With no captain?

01:31:55.110 --> 01:31:56.290
You shall be Captain Rodriguez.

01:31:57.470 --> 01:31:58.890
I will do with the necessary letters.

01:32:00.730 --> 01:32:02.190
The captain's chair will be yours.

01:32:04.680 --> 01:32:06.260
Captain? Me?

01:32:09.050 --> 01:32:09.990
And governor of Macau?

01:32:10.540 --> 01:32:13.240
Yes, Captain Pilate and governor of Macau.

01:32:15.040 --> 01:32:18.700
Well, Captain, it seems the devil's luck is on your back as well,

01:32:18.860 --> 01:32:19.620
but it won't be enough.

01:32:21.230 --> 01:32:21.990
What do you mean, Inglês?

01:32:22.430 --> 01:32:23.690
I'll sail after you, Rodriguez.

01:32:24.320 --> 01:32:26.060
I'll sail after the black ship.

01:32:27.320 --> 01:32:27.860
With what?

01:32:28.940 --> 01:32:29.980
You have no shipping, Inglês.

01:32:30.000 --> 01:32:33.400
At Angiro. And my eyes are healing.

01:32:34.300 --> 01:32:35.320
I'll catch you at sea.

01:32:37.820 --> 01:32:40.520
Erasmus is dead, burned to her spite.

01:32:41.940 --> 01:32:43.410
A Spaniard's wish.

01:32:43.680 --> 01:32:47.140
It's true. It was the hand of God.

01:32:48.010 --> 01:32:48.650
You lie.

01:32:49.470 --> 01:32:51.810
No, Captain Blackthorn. He speaks the truth.

01:32:53.780 --> 01:32:55.600
A tidal wave healed your ship.

01:32:57.460 --> 01:32:59.080
The oil lamps on deck spread fire.

01:32:59.140 --> 01:32:59.800
I don't believe you.

01:33:00.350 --> 01:33:01.070
Before God.

01:33:06.890 --> 01:33:07.930
You're beached in place.

01:33:10.000 --> 01:33:10.820
You're marooned.

01:33:12.290 --> 01:33:13.090
You're here forever.

01:33:28.820 --> 01:33:29.960
I'm going to carry you to hell, Roderick!

01:33:32.640 --> 01:33:40.880
They may, Inglis, they may, but you will never sail again.

01:34:28.030 --> 01:34:28.490
as the captain.

01:34:30.000 --> 01:34:42.700
to set sail now we're going back to anjiro but you said maggotsaki now big damn you now you are

01:34:42.700 --> 01:34:51.860
safe here captain backpaw i will leave you now why why did you save me for your soul and mine and

01:34:51.860 --> 01:34:55.300
and what that is reasonable

01:35:00.000 --> 01:35:01.460
Goodbye, Anjinsai.

01:35:04.380 --> 01:35:05.040
Go with God.

01:35:12.830 --> 01:35:13.570
Told him, pilot.

01:35:15.030 --> 01:35:15.950
Tanjiro it is.

01:35:17.460 --> 01:35:18.340
Sogi Natai!

01:35:19.290 --> 01:35:19.850
Ice pilot!

01:35:21.920 --> 01:35:22.340
It's a miss.

01:35:24.260 --> 01:35:24.760
They told me.

01:35:24.900 --> 01:35:28.970
They told me the Erasmus is lost.

01:35:31.240 --> 01:35:32.300
Our ship is lost.

01:35:32.460 --> 01:35:32.900
Fire!

01:36:13.440 --> 01:36:14.080
Can you see her, yeah?

01:36:15.080 --> 01:36:17.840
No, pilot. Still not at the point.

01:36:18.810 --> 01:36:20.200
It's Hogi! It's Hogi!

01:36:55.790 --> 01:36:56.110
See you, Bink.

01:37:08.380 --> 01:37:08.960
Is it true?

01:37:10.530 --> 01:37:11.310
Aye, pilot.

01:37:12.740 --> 01:37:14.300
Even more true than that.

01:37:32.840 --> 01:37:59.360
What you see just lying what's left of her the ground match it's gone

01:38:00.990 --> 01:38:03.640
Dex gone. Everything.

01:38:05.480 --> 01:38:06.160
Dear God.

01:38:06.450 --> 01:38:07.770
What about the keel? Can you see it?

01:38:09.350 --> 01:38:14.010
Aye. Looks like the beached monkeys.

01:38:22.320 --> 01:38:26.340
You've got cursed fire. You've got cursed shore.

01:38:27.980 --> 01:38:28.680
You'll beach her.

01:38:30.000 --> 01:38:37.800
But, uh, even these heathens, oh, they should never have left her to them.

01:38:38.000 --> 01:38:42.040
What are we going to do now?

01:38:43.820 --> 01:38:44.700
How are we going to get home?

01:38:48.030 --> 01:38:49.450
Should have left her to Yaddle.

01:38:52.430 --> 01:38:53.410
Maybe they did beat her.

01:38:54.860 --> 01:38:59.710
Yes, but the muck eaters didn't put out the fire.

01:39:01.020 --> 01:39:02.380
God, curse them all to hell.

01:39:02.520 --> 01:39:11.880
You should never have let Chapo's honor.

01:39:16.590 --> 01:39:17.490
You're helpless now.

01:39:18.870 --> 01:39:19.310
We're dead.

01:39:20.740 --> 01:39:21.520
The ship is dead.

01:39:23.000 --> 01:39:23.740
The Erasmus.

01:39:24.970 --> 01:39:26.170
That was Albedo's curse.

01:39:27.020 --> 01:39:27.240
What?

01:39:28.330 --> 01:39:29.450
The priest, Father Albedo.

01:39:30.510 --> 01:39:31.750
He said the die was cast.

01:39:32.820 --> 01:39:33.620
What are you talking about?

01:39:35.720 --> 01:39:37.120
He said I'd never leave these islands.

01:39:39.390 --> 01:39:39.790
Marooned.

01:39:40.960 --> 01:39:43.000
For the rest of our lives, aren't we, pilot?

01:39:48.820 --> 01:39:53.390
Through these God-cursed heathens for the rest of our muck-eating lives.

01:39:54.540 --> 01:39:59.970
How long will that be when all they talk about is war, war, war?

01:40:00.980 --> 01:40:02.280
Answer me, pilot.

01:40:03.090 --> 01:40:03.790
Yes, think now.

01:40:03.930 --> 01:40:04.270
Shut up.

01:40:07.790 --> 01:40:11.880
I speak when I dance.

01:40:12.040 --> 01:40:13.640
You say when I dance, please.

01:40:15.200 --> 01:40:15.980
It's your fault.

01:40:16.670 --> 01:40:20.460
You, you missing place.

01:40:23.070 --> 01:40:25.990
Said, come to the Japans.

01:40:31.120 --> 01:40:31.860
How many died?

01:40:32.370 --> 01:40:32.630
Tell me.

01:40:34.860 --> 01:40:36.220
Answer me that if you can.

01:40:37.310 --> 01:40:38.410
I'd rot you!

01:40:38.530 --> 01:40:39.270
You're to blame!

01:40:39.630 --> 01:40:39.850
Yes!

01:40:41.900 --> 01:40:42.660
Blame is mine!

01:40:43.570 --> 01:40:44.710
Does that make you feel better?

01:40:44.770 --> 01:40:45.610
What do you want me to tell you?

01:40:49.420 --> 01:40:50.100
Sorry, Vink.

01:40:52.470 --> 01:40:52.650
Sorry.

01:40:59.030 --> 01:40:59.970
Is that all you-

01:41:02.240 --> 01:41:03.340
We're going to get home.

01:41:04.860 --> 01:41:05.620
I don't know.

01:41:07.290 --> 01:41:07.830
Got to know.

01:41:08.890 --> 01:41:10.030
Damn you, you're the...

01:41:10.920 --> 01:41:12.260
What do you expect me to do, Vink?

01:41:12.740 --> 01:41:13.580
Change what's happened?

01:41:14.240 --> 01:41:15.340
If I could...

01:41:19.460 --> 01:41:20.640
Heart's been torn out, Vink.

01:41:21.130 --> 01:41:22.170
Can't you understand that?

01:41:23.560 --> 01:41:26.000
When the ship is lost, my dreams lost wither.

01:41:27.940 --> 01:41:28.300
Everything.

01:41:29.500 --> 01:41:29.980
They've taken...

01:41:30.000 --> 01:41:31.380
everything of value from my life.

01:41:34.060 --> 01:41:36.310
She's gone, Vink, and I can't change that.

01:41:37.870 --> 01:41:38.250
Gone.

01:41:42.610 --> 01:41:45.990
Another of our ships will come here someday.

01:41:46.210 --> 01:41:47.010
We'll just have to wait.

01:41:53.090 --> 01:41:53.370
Wait.

01:41:58.360 --> 01:41:59.760
How long we're going to wait?

01:42:02.010 --> 01:42:06.030
Five muck-plagued years went here.

01:42:07.450 --> 01:42:11.070
The rest of our rotten, miserable lives.

01:42:12.170 --> 01:42:20.770
These black-eyed muck-monkens!

01:42:21.640 --> 01:42:24.340
Always gibbering and staring at you!

01:42:25.230 --> 01:42:26.730
You can't try to look at them anymore!

01:42:29.290 --> 01:42:29.590
Jesus!

01:42:30.640 --> 01:42:31.360
Jesus!

01:42:38.020 --> 01:42:39.100
No, there's war!

01:42:40.980 --> 01:42:41.980
It's what you said, isn't it?

01:42:44.540 --> 01:42:46.820
Running around with a damn sword!

01:42:49.390 --> 01:42:57.330
I gotta kill yourself, think!

01:43:00.570 --> 01:43:02.390
The monkeys are coming for us!

01:43:03.770 --> 01:43:05.250
I'm gonna chop up my head!

01:43:06.020 --> 01:43:06.680
Come on!

01:43:06.800 --> 01:43:07.460
I'm gonna do it!

01:43:07.810 --> 01:43:08.190
Do it!

01:43:08.570 --> 01:43:08.690
Do it!

01:43:08.870 --> 01:43:09.230
Do it!

01:43:09.910 --> 01:43:10.490
Do it!

01:45:32.940 --> 01:45:33.100
Thank you.

01:46:37.130 --> 01:46:37.230
Thank you.

01:47:18.300 --> 01:47:24.130
I fell asleep.

01:47:24.350 --> 01:47:25.960
Do you understand?

01:47:26.220 --> 01:47:26.340
No.

01:47:30.000 --> 01:47:30.180
Yes, I will.

01:47:30.640 --> 01:47:40.010
Ito.

01:47:40.030 --> 01:47:44.660
Bish! Burn my ship!

01:47:45.300 --> 01:47:45.460
Wait!

01:48:03.260 --> 01:48:03.860
Get out of here!

01:49:01.760 --> 01:49:02.380
Anjin-sama.

01:49:02.440 --> 01:49:13.460
Yes, Anjin-sama.

01:49:13.560 --> 01:49:14.200
It's me.

01:49:16.280 --> 01:49:17.600
I'm sorry to have disturbed you.

01:49:17.800 --> 01:49:25.210
Good evening, Fujika-san.

01:49:25.310 --> 01:49:28.240
Lord Hanagawa is calling you.

01:49:28.460 --> 01:49:29.660
He'll be right there.

01:49:30.660 --> 01:49:32.230
Yes, I will.

01:49:34.250 --> 01:49:53.090
No one knows who ordered to destroy the ship of the criminal or who helped him.

01:49:55.380 --> 01:49:58.360
Yes, I have never prayed.

01:50:15.030 --> 01:50:17.290
Lord Toronaga has questioned me about the burning of your ship.

01:50:18.450 --> 01:50:23.140
I told him that neither I nor anyone I know of ordered or assisted in the sabotage of your ship.

01:50:24.250 --> 01:50:25.070
He may believe you.

01:50:26.850 --> 01:50:27.370
I don't.

01:50:30.000 --> 01:50:36.820
Lord Toronaga requests that I swear a holy oath to you and to him that I'm speaking the truth.

01:50:38.080 --> 01:50:44.440
He demands it, or he says that he will withdraw all his support forever from me and my church.

01:50:45.840 --> 01:50:49.760
Then swear, priest, swear your holiest oath.

01:50:51.190 --> 01:50:55.320
And then will you believe me? Will you?

01:51:11.640 --> 01:51:15.730
I swear solemnly before God the Father, the Son, and the Holy Ghost,

01:51:17.720 --> 01:51:20.890
before all things sacred and holy, that I speak the truth.

01:51:22.230 --> 01:51:26.090
Neither I nor anyone I know of ordered or assisted in the burning of your ship.

01:51:27.650 --> 01:51:29.960
This I swear before God.

01:51:44.320 --> 01:51:45.400
Oh God.

01:51:45.400 --> 01:51:50.290
Lord Tornaga asks if you believe me now.

01:51:56.990 --> 01:51:57.670
Yes, Tornaga.

01:51:59.420 --> 01:51:59.700
I believe.

01:52:03.740 --> 01:52:13.080
I am not your enemy, pilot. In fact, I'm a better friend than you suspect.

01:52:30.060 --> 01:52:33.220
May I hand over your order to the criminal?

01:52:34.160 --> 01:52:43.440
As you command.

01:52:44.460 --> 01:52:47.570
I'll give this to the criminal.

01:52:52.590 --> 01:52:55.030
Lord Torunaga has just given you this lady's contract.

01:52:55.390 --> 01:52:58.560
She now belongs to you.

01:52:58.640 --> 01:52:59.450
Belongs?

01:53:04.860 --> 01:53:18.620
Lord Toronaga said that you may do with her as you wish.

01:53:19.600 --> 01:53:20.820
What did he mean, the love?

01:53:22.420 --> 01:53:26.040
She is yours. You own this lady.

01:53:37.390 --> 01:53:38.540
Yes, Mr. Andin.

01:53:48.480 --> 01:53:49.120
Yes, sir?

01:53:50.040 --> 01:53:57.000
Yes, sir. Thank you very much.

01:54:07.740 --> 01:54:08.740
Mr. Anjin.

01:54:10.396 --> 01:54:11.696
I am truly honored.

01:54:56.100 --> 01:54:56.460
Is it a call from Mr. Nanagata?

01:55:03.610 --> 01:55:06.450
Lord Turanaga's request was a simple one.

01:55:06.750 --> 01:55:11.870
Would Lord Yabu please explain why he killed Captain Yoshinaka?

01:55:15.670 --> 01:55:18.310
Who dares to accuse me? Yabu demanded.

01:56:07.770 --> 01:56:09.860
I'm sorry, I didn't mean to startle you.

01:56:15.550 --> 01:56:16.370
I shall be leaving in the morning.

01:56:17.940 --> 01:56:19.340
I don't know if we'll have a chance to talk again.

01:56:19.620 --> 01:56:20.900
And there are some things I would like to say.

01:56:23.170 --> 01:56:23.630
Then say them.

01:56:31.660 --> 01:56:36.080
I wanted you to know before I go that I know what the loss of Mariko-san means to you.

01:56:38.420 --> 01:56:45.340
And I wanted you to know that I know what you meant to her.

01:56:47.550 --> 01:56:48.410
How could you know that?

01:56:50.270 --> 01:56:54.010
She came to me the night you left Yedo.

01:57:00.190 --> 01:57:02.030
I'm afraid our destinies are interlocked, pilot.

01:57:03.590 --> 01:57:04.850
Did Mariko Sain ever tell you that?

01:57:04.970 --> 01:57:07.220
She told me.

01:57:09.170 --> 01:57:10.130
What else did she tell you?

01:57:11.740 --> 01:57:17.220
She asked me to be your friend, to protect you if I could.

01:57:20.800 --> 01:57:21.460
And I will try.

01:57:25.040 --> 01:57:28.940
You see, you will never leave here, Anjinsan.

01:57:32.880 --> 01:57:36.220
I told you that before, and I say it again with no malice, truly.

01:57:38.620 --> 01:57:42.030
A brave man, fine adversary, one to respect, and I do.

01:57:43.980 --> 01:57:45.320
There should be peace between us.

01:57:46.830 --> 01:57:47.530
How can that be?

01:57:58.120 --> 01:57:59.600
Please, go to the earth.

01:58:00.670 --> 01:58:01.450
Lord Yabu is calling you.

01:58:02.690 --> 01:58:21.110
Lord Anjin, this sword...

01:58:21.110 --> 01:58:24.620
Die in commemoration of your arrival at Aji.

01:58:25.300 --> 01:58:28.480
I once again managed to defeat that barbarian.

01:58:30.090 --> 01:58:30.550
It's a blessing.

01:58:32.760 --> 01:58:36.500
Noriyabu says that he gives you his sword to commemorate your arrival at Anjiro,

01:58:37.810 --> 01:58:44.430
and as a thank you for the pleasure, pleasure that boiling that barbarian gave him.

01:58:45.490 --> 01:58:46.930
Anjiro, listen to me.

01:58:48.990 --> 01:58:51.010
This is the hellhole, you guys!

01:58:52.500 --> 01:58:55.040
You can't take this sword, you can't take this sword!

01:58:55.040 --> 01:58:56.260
You can't take this sword!

01:58:57.320 --> 01:58:58.880
You can take this sword, you can take it!

01:59:00.250 --> 01:59:05.820
Lord Yabu says that none of these manure eaters deserves the blade.

01:59:06.890 --> 01:59:09.800
You do. Take it, please.

01:59:33.480 --> 01:59:35.620
I want you to be my witness.

01:59:49.320 --> 01:59:52.750
Please follow me!

01:59:52.850 --> 01:59:55.830
Yes sir!

02:00:07.870 --> 02:00:10.590
The real samurai will die in the world.

02:00:11.260 --> 02:00:14.200
Lord Yabu says that now you will see how a real samurai dies.

02:00:20.000 --> 02:00:20.980
This is the final fate.

02:00:25.040 --> 02:00:28.120
We will be flying the earth and we will be flying the world.

02:00:30.250 --> 02:00:31.630
This is the dream of my mother.

02:00:33.310 --> 02:00:44.890
I will sing for the Lord Yavu's death poem.

02:00:45.930 --> 02:00:51.280
It goes blue sky above the earth, white clouds rise towards heaven.

02:00:52.800 --> 02:00:54.560
Life is only a butterfly's dream.

02:00:55.850 --> 02:00:57.960
Death, the way to eternal life.

02:01:23.644 --> 02:01:24.644
Let's do this!

02:02:05.532 --> 02:02:06.032
What?

02:02:34.830 --> 02:02:41.180
Oumi, I want you to hand over the Ajiro you have as a new Izu fisherman to Anjin.

02:02:42.040 --> 02:02:44.400
Yes, sir.

02:02:45.420 --> 02:02:51.780
Anjin, I want you to take care of the Ajiro right away.

02:03:02.810 --> 02:03:03.770
Yes, Toranaga-sama.

02:03:05.500 --> 02:03:08.920
Hanji, I'm not sure how to do it as a samurai and Hatamoto.

02:03:10.720 --> 02:03:12.790
Why are you doing it like that?

02:03:15.370 --> 02:03:18.360
Lord Toranaga has made you a samurai and Hatamoto.

02:03:19.620 --> 02:03:22.180
He asks why you are standing here so stupid and weak.

02:03:25.020 --> 02:03:26.120
Sorry, Toranaga-sama.

02:03:49.600 --> 02:03:52.000
Before Mariko left Yedo, she gave this to Lord Toronaga.

02:03:53.070 --> 02:03:55.490
She said if you were still alive after Osaka, you were to have it.

02:03:56.600 --> 02:03:59.280
Lord Toronaga asks, if you are still alive.

02:04:04.880 --> 02:04:05.520
よしでは生きてるように振る舞え。

02:04:05.520 --> 02:04:14.460
What Taranaka said, then act alive.

02:05:17.630 --> 02:05:28.970
I love this is read by thee. Then I am dead in Osaka. And perhaps because of me, a sheep is dead too.

02:05:31.790 --> 02:05:35.770
I may sacrifice this most prized part of thy life because of my faith

02:05:35.770 --> 02:05:38.900
to safeguard my church

02:05:38.900 --> 02:05:43.260
more to save thy life which is more precious to me than anything

02:05:47.260 --> 02:05:49.680
even the interest of my lord Turanaga

02:05:49.680 --> 02:05:52.630
it may come to a choice, my love

02:05:53.620 --> 02:05:55.050
See, what a shit

02:05:57.860 --> 02:05:59.980
Sorry, I choose life for-

02:06:00.000 --> 02:06:06.770
Thy ship is stormed anyway, with or without thee.

02:06:09.280 --> 02:06:12.980
I will concede thy ship to thine enemy, so that thou may live.

02:06:14.930 --> 02:06:20.760
This ship is nothing. Build another. This thou can do.

02:06:23.580 --> 02:06:27.340
Lord Trinaga will give thee all the craftsmen and carpenters necessary.

02:06:30.920 --> 02:06:37.980
He needs you and your ships, and from my personal estate, I have will to thee all the money necessary.

02:06:43.550 --> 02:06:46.550
Another ship and build another life, Myra.

02:06:49.170 --> 02:06:56.570
Take next year's black ship and live forever, dear one.

02:06:59.320 --> 02:06:59.980
Just all, pray.

02:07:00.030 --> 02:07:02.980
best to can in a Christian heaven.

02:07:04.220 --> 02:07:06.940
My Japanese Hara prays that in the next life,

02:07:07.150 --> 02:07:10.250
I will be whatever is necessary to bring thee joy

